msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Language: zh_Hans\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\n"

msgid "Phone"
msgstr "电话"

msgid ""
"Calls are carried by the mobile network (VoLTE) and handed to a Bluetooth "
"headset and/or SIP phones on this device. This page configures the SIP "
"accounts, where calls go, and the audio path. Changes take effect as soon "
"as they are applied; a call in progress is not interrupted."
msgstr ""
"通话由移动网络（VoLTE）承载，并转接到本设备上的蓝牙耳机和/或 SIP 电话。"
"本页配置 SIP 账号、通话去向以及音频路径。应用后立即生效；进行中的通话不会被中断。"

msgid "Status helper"
msgstr "状态助手"

msgid "not available"
msgstr "不可用"

msgid "Modem"
msgstr "Modem"

msgid "IMS registration"
msgstr "IMS 注册"

msgid "Audio DSP"
msgstr "音频 DSP"

msgid "not responding"
msgstr "无响应"

msgid "calls connect but carry no audio; reboot the device"
msgstr "通话可接通但无音频；请重启设备"

msgid "Call daemon"
msgstr "通话守护进程"

msgid "IMS data service"
msgstr "IMS 数据服务"

msgid "Bluetooth HFP"
msgstr "蓝牙 HFP"

msgid "Audio bridge"
msgstr "音频桥接"

msgid "running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "Services"
msgstr "服务"

msgid "Active calls"
msgstr "活动通话"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Service"
msgstr "服务"

msgid "Run the IMS data service"
msgstr "运行 IMS 数据服务"

msgid ""
"Lets the modem register for VoLTE. Without it the modem has no IMS data "
"connection and calls fall back to the circuit-switched network (which this "
"device does not have on 4G)."
msgstr ""
"允许 Modem 注册 VoLTE。没有它，Modem 没有 IMS 数据连接，通话会回落到电路交换网络"
"（本设备在 4G 下没有该网络）。"

msgid "Where calls go"
msgstr "通话去向"

msgid "Bluetooth headset and SIP phones"
msgstr "蓝牙耳机和 SIP 电话"

msgid "Bluetooth headset only"
msgstr "仅蓝牙耳机"

msgid "SIP phones only"
msgstr "仅 SIP 电话"

msgid "Answer on the device, no audio routing"
msgstr "在设备上接听，不进行音频路由"

msgid "Auto-answer after (seconds)"
msgstr "自动接听延迟（秒）"

msgid "0 never answers by itself."
msgstr "0 表示永不自动接听。"

msgid "Manage auto-answer"
msgstr "管理自动接听"

msgid ""
"Stops the ModemManager auto-answer service while this daemon runs, so the "
"two cannot both answer a call."
msgstr ""
"本守护进程运行期间停止 ModemManager 自动接听服务，避免两者同时接听同一来电。"

msgid "Incoming call notifications"
msgstr "来电通知"

msgid ""
"A phone whose SIP client has been suspended by the system (iOS does this "
"to any app in the background) has no registration, so Asterisk cannot ring "
"it at all. A push notification wakes the phone; opening the client "
"re-registers it and the call is rung while it still rings. Messages are "
"sent through ntfy, which needs no account."
msgstr ""
"若手机的 SIP 客户端被系统挂起（iOS 对后台应用会如此），则没有注册，Asterisk 完全"
"无法振铃。推送通知可唤醒手机；打开客户端会重新注册，通话在其仍振铃期间接入。"
"消息通过 ntfy 发送，无需账号。"

msgid "Send a notification"
msgstr "发送通知"

msgid "Sends one message per incoming call, with the caller's number."
msgstr "每有一个来电发送一条消息，包含主叫号码。"

msgid "ntfy server"
msgstr "ntfy 服务器"

msgid "The server to post to. Use https://ntfy.sh, or your own if you run one."
msgstr "消息发布到的服务器。可用 https://ntfy.sh，或你自建的服务器。"

msgid "Topic"
msgstr "主题"

msgid ""
"The topic your phone subscribes to in the ntfy app. Anyone who knows it "
"can read the messages, so pick something unguessable."
msgstr "手机在 ntfy 应用中订阅的主题。任何知道该主题的人都能读取消息，请选择难以猜测的主题。"

msgid "Access token"
msgstr "访问令牌"

msgid "Only for a server with access control. Left empty, no token is sent."
msgstr "仅用于带访问控制的服务器。留空则不发送令牌。"

msgid "Open on tap"
msgstr "点击时打开"

msgid ""
"A link to open when the notification is tapped, instead of the ntfy app. "
"Point it at a URI your softphone registers — for example "
"<code>sip:100@192.168.8.1</code>, or the app's own scheme such as "
"<code>linphone:</code> or <code>zoiper:</code>. One tap then opens the "
"client and re-registers it. Does nothing if no app claims that URI. Leave "
"empty to keep opening the ntfy app."
msgstr ""
"点击通知时打开的链接（而非 ntfy 应用）。指向软电话注册的 URI——例如 "
"<code>sip:100@192.168.8.1</code>，或应用自身的 scheme，如 "
"<code>linphone:</code> 或 <code>zoiper:</code>。点一下即可打开客户端并重新注册。"
"若没有应用声明该 URI 则无效果。留空则继续打开 ntfy 应用。"

msgid "Topic password"
msgstr "主题密码"

msgid ""
"Encrypts the message end to end, so the server only stores ciphertext. Set "
"the same password on the topic in the app (topic menu, End-to-end "
"encryption). Left empty, the message is sent in the clear and anyone who "
"knows the topic can read it."
msgstr ""
"对消息端到端加密，服务器只存储密文。请在应用中为主题设置相同密码"
"（主题菜单 → 端到端加密）。留空则明文发送，任何知道主题的人都能读取。"

msgid "SIP accounts"
msgstr "SIP 账号"

msgid ""
"Phones that register to Asterisk on this device. The dialplan sends every "
"call to the mobile network, and incoming mobile calls ring all accounts at "
"once. Leave the password empty to have one generated."
msgstr ""
"注册到本设备 Asterisk 的电话。拨号计划将每个呼叫送往移动网络，来移动侧的来电同时"
"振铃所有账号。密码留空将自动生成。"

msgid "Number"
msgstr "号码"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "密码"

msgid "generated"
msgstr "已生成"

msgid "Also written to /etc/asterisk/ufi-voice-phones.txt on the device."
msgstr "同时写入设备上的 /etc/asterisk/ufi-voice-phones.txt。"

msgid "Registered"
msgstr "已注册"

msgid "no"
msgstr "否"

msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

msgid "Audio"
msgstr "音频"

msgid "Jitter buffer (ms)"
msgstr "抖动缓冲（毫秒）"

msgid ""
"Audio from the phones is buffered this long before it is played into the "
"call. Raise it if the far end hears choppy speech over Wi-Fi; lower it to "
"reduce delay. 40 ms suits a wired or good Wi-Fi link."
msgstr ""
"来自电话的音频在送入通话前缓冲此长时长。若对端通过 Wi-Fi 听到断续语音可调大；"
"调小可降低延迟。40 ms 适合有线或良好的 Wi-Fi 链路。"

msgid "PCM rate"
msgstr "PCM 采样率"

msgid ""
"Sample rate of the in-call audio device. 48 kHz gives 10 ms periods, which "
"is what the DSP expects."
msgstr "通话音频设备的采样率。48 kHz 给出 10 ms 周期，正是 DSP 所期望的。"

msgid "Mute the unused microphone port"
msgstr "静音未使用的麦克风端口"

msgid ""
"Keeps the internal Bluetooth SCO microphone out of the call, so only the "
"phones supply uplink audio."
msgstr "将内置蓝牙 SCO 麦克风排除在通话之外，使上行音频仅来自电话。"

msgid "Log audio statistics"
msgstr "记录音频统计"

msgid ""
"Writes a voicebridge statistics line to the system log every 5 seconds. "
"Useful when diagnosing choppy audio; leave off otherwise."
msgstr "每 5 秒向系统日志写入一行 voicebridge 统计。便于诊断断续音频；否则请关闭。"

msgid "Bluetooth headset"
msgstr "蓝牙耳机"

msgid "Headset address"
msgstr "耳机地址"

msgid ""
"MAC address of the headset to connect to, e.g. 00:11:22:33:44:55. Pair it "
"first with bluetoothctl."
msgstr ""
"要连接的耳机 MAC 地址，例如 00:11:22:33:44:55。请先用 bluetoothctl 配对。"

msgid "Reconnect backoff (seconds)"
msgstr "重连退避（秒）"

msgid ""
"How long to keep paging a disconnected headset, doubling from 60 s. Each "
"page briefly blinds the Wi-Fi station (shared 2.4 GHz radio). 0 never "
"pages."
msgstr ""
"对已断开耳机持续寻呼的时长，从 60 秒起翻倍。每次寻呼会短暂影响 Wi-Fi Station"
"（共享 2.4 GHz 射频）。0 表示永不寻呼。"

msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgid "Voice session"
msgstr "语音会话"

msgid ""
"DSP voice path used for call audio. Auto picks VoLTE while IMS is "
"registered and the circuit-switched session otherwise."
msgstr "用于通话音频的 DSP 语音路径。自动模式在 IMS 注册时选 VoLTE，否则选电路交换会话。"

msgid "Auto"
msgstr "自动"

msgid "VoLTE"
msgstr "VoLTE"

msgid "Circuit switched"
msgstr "电路交换"

msgid "AudioSocket port"
msgstr "AudioSocket 端口"

msgid "Asterisk AMI user"
msgstr "Asterisk AMI 用户"

msgid "Asterisk AMI password"
msgstr "Asterisk AMI 密码"

msgid "Left empty, a random password is generated and shared with Asterisk."
msgstr "留空将生成随机密码并与 Asterisk 共享。"

msgid "Mobile interface"
msgstr "移动网络接口"

msgid "netifd interface of the mobile data connection."
msgstr "移动数据连接的 netifd 接口。"

msgid "Restart IMS after (seconds)"
msgstr "IMS 重启延迟（秒）"

msgid ""
"Restarts the IMS data service when IMS has had no connection for this "
"long, doubling up to one hour while that does not help. 0 never."
msgstr ""
"IMS 无连接持续此时长后重启 IMS 数据服务；若无改善则退避翻倍，最长一小时。0 表示永不。"

msgid "Saved, but applying failed: "
msgstr "已保存，但应用失败："
